{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e5a8715-1cac-84ca-bde9-dedda19d690e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-07T11:39:52-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Holly Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. Yes, my name is Holly Almy. I am calling for my mother. Her trash was not picked up this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry to hear that. What's the address where the trash is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "319 Carroll Avenue. In Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "319 Carroll Avenue. Got it. And what's the usual pickup day for her?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually is Tuesday. Yesterday. The bin is still at the curb, full. Nobody took it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the bin went out Tuesday morning and it's still sitting there as of today, Wednesday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Exactly. I drove there this morning to check. Is still there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:36:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Was it out early enough, do you know? Sometimes the trucks come before people expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mother put it out Monday night. So yes, early. [pause] Other neighbors, their bins are empty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the neighbors were picked up and hers was skipped. I'll note that down. Did you try to report it online first?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I tried. The website wants me to prove I am not robot. It showed pictures and asked me to find crosswalks. I picked wrong, I think. It said fail. I tried again, same thing. So I call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:37:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, those are annoying. No, you did the right thing calling. I can take the report from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's 319 Carroll Avenue, Tuesday pickup missed, bin was out Monday night. Is it trash or recycling, or both?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Trash. Only the trash bin. Recycling she did not put out this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, trash only. I'll send that to the crew supervisor so they can look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And when is next pickup? Should she leave bin where it is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:35-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Her next regular pickup would be next Tuesday. I'd leave the bin at the curb for now in case they come back for a missed stop, but I can't promise what day that'll be. They sometimes catch those up in a day or two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:38:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So leave it at curb, and maybe they come. If not, next Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And if it's still there Friday, give us a call back and we'll push it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Friday. I will call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want to leave a callback number in case the supervisor has a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0167. And that's Holly, H-O-L-L-Y?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Last name Almy, A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Holly Almy, 401-555-0167. I've got it all down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. That is all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-07T11:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
